# AI Lead Vision website - ground rules

Company: AI Lead Vision Pvt Ltd, Bengaluru, India. B2B: AI, Computer Vision, Robotics,
Industrial Automation, Automotive Software, Custom Software Development.

- Modify the existing Next.js site incrementally. Never rewrite pages or components from scratch.
- Never invent facts. Use clear placeholders for real data: [X years], [N projects],
  [Client Name], [Testimonial here], [Screenshot here], [Video here].
- Only show technologies and capabilities the owner has listed. Do not add new ones.
- Keep the design modern, visual and mobile-friendly; reuse existing tokens in
  app/globals.css and components in components/ui.
- Company facts, navigation and contacts live in lib/content/site.ts; page copy lives in
  lib/content/*.ts. Edit content there rather than hardcoding it in components.
- Keep statistics.publish false and address.confirmed null until the owner confirms them.
